  "plain": "In 1960s Washington, the psychologist Timothy Leary, known for promoting the drug LSD, is said to have supplied LSD to President John F. Kennedy and to Mary Pinchot Meyer, a Washington artist close to Kennedy. The lawyer Dan Sheehan says this, passing on what he says he was told, in a longer account of Kennedy and what he knew about UFOs. In Sheehan's words, the drug was \"provided by Tim Leary\"."
